==================================================

Before changing code:

1. Audit the existing site architecture.
2. Identify reusable components.
3. Identify existing design tokens.
4. Identify current deep-dive routes.
5. Inspect engineering repositories referenced by the portfolio.
6. Build an evidence inventory.
7. Propose the new homepage information architecture.
8. Implement incrementally.
9. Preserve existing routes.
10. Verify responsive behavior.
11. Verify links.
12. Run tests/build.
13. Report exactly what changed.

Do not start by deleting existing components.

Reuse and refactor wherever practical.

